\fBEcosystem Plugins:\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \fBziro\-ghost\fP
Predictive autocomplete and ghost text suggestions based on history and context.
.TP
.B \fBfast\-syntax\-highlighting\fP
Real-time, high-speed syntax highlighting for commands, paths, and quotes.
.TP
.B \fBzsh\-completions\fP
Additional completion definitions for hundreds of CLI utilities.
.TP
.B \fBzsh\-autosuggestions\fP
Fish-like history-based suggestion engine.
.TP
.B \fBzsh\-history\-substring\-search\fP
Search command history by typing any substring and pressing Up/Down.
.TP
.B \fBfzf\-tab\fP
Interactive fuzzy selection menu replacing standard tab completions.
.TP
.B \fBzsh\-autopair\fP
Automatically balances parentheses, brackets, and quotes during typing.
.TP
.B \fBzsh\-you\-should\-use\fP
Reminds you of active aliases when you type the full command.
.TP
.B \fBzoxide\fP
Frecency-based directory jumper (\fBz\fP).
.TP
.B \fBohmyzsh\-git\fP
Git aliases, branch indicators, and completion functions.
.TP
.B \fBohmyzsh\-colored\-man\-pages\fP
Colorized man pages using terminal termcaps.
.TP
.B \fBohmyzsh\-ssh\-agent\fP
Automatic SSH agent start, key forwarding, and socket reuse.
.TP
.B \fBziro\-defer\fP
Idle-cycle execution engine powering sub-millisecond startup.
